{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/e62ac0f8ec2de865c0632a02085c5f1d.poster.avif?t=1758846340\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/e62ac0f8ec2de865c0632a02085c5f1d.webm?t=1758846340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/e62ac0f8ec2de865c0632a02085c5f1d.mp4?t=1758846340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Factor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Exhale has been developed from the ground up with one of the most advanced monster A.I.'s ever made. Specifically designed to not only hunt the player but toy with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/dc9cb0725639f7aff77d8795c937343f.poster.avif?t=1758846340\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/dc9cb0725639f7aff77d8795c937343f.webm?t=1758846340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/dc9cb0725639f7aff77d8795c937343f.mp4?t=1758846340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfectly Designed For Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Especially catered and created to utilize retention for videos and streams, this is the next evolution of horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.poster.avif?t=1758846340\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.webm?t=1758846340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.mp4?t=1758846340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles and Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With everything you discover you'll have environmental story telling. No notes to slow you down, only real voice actors and thousands of years of lore written into a single experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.poster.avif?t=1758846340\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.webm?t=1758846340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.mp4?t=1758846340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3305120?t=1758846340","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/3708929f90e0c663ac6e576d209d9df113afdd50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758846340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/634ddd329ca9670d8f4ae15d9935fe2e3b565e56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758846340","capsule_imagev5":"https://sh